exercise.en:
1. Experiment with incorporating multiple adjacent frames as input channels in a 3D U-Net model to enhance detection accuracy;
2. Implement synthetic augmentation by extracting real cell trajectories, dimming and blurring them, and inserting into training samples to improve recognition of faint cells;
3. Construct a temporal graph from detector candidate points, designing scoring functions for plausible track linking and cell division identification;
4. Develop a post-processing step that revisits unused high-confidence detections and recovers missed tracks based on temporal and spatial continuity.
